abstract: "Source-pinned Python analyses and author-created empirical exhibits supporting Momentum as a Market Regularity. Includes U.S. stock and industry momentum, international factor diagnostics, an analysis of AQR multi-asset time-series momentum factors, and an exact-202609 source-replayed 1927–2026 long-only U.S. market-to-Treasury-bills absolute-momentum experiment with original Figure 7. Third-party original datasets are not redistributed, and the complete all-input archived-vintage replay has not been independently executed in a clean environment."
